{
  "_meta": {
    "step": "home_world",
    "source": "Rogue Trader Core Rulebook + Into the Storm",
    "status": "Core reconciled-by-hand from Core book pp.17-23. Into the Storm 'New Home Worlds' (Advanced Origins) reconciled from ItS pp.9-15 (printed folios; PDF pages 10-16). Verify vs errata.",
    "scope": "Core (Death/Void Born/Forge/Hive/Imperial/Noble Born) plus the six Into the Storm advanced Home Worlds (Frontier World, Footfallen, Fortress World, Battlefleet, Penal World, Child of Dynasty). ItS home worlds are FREE swaps -- ItS p.9 states a player 'may replace the current Home World options with these new options' with no xp cost (the Excel HomeWorldList has no cost column for them). Each ItS home world 'may be taken instead of' a specific Core home world (recorded as substitutes_for metadata). ItS Advanced Origins is the human path (Kroot/Ork use separate background rules, ItS pp.49-57), so each ItS home world requires species Human.",
    "rules_qa": [
      "Provenance pages are PRINTED FOLIOS (ItS folio = PDF page index - 1; anchored on PDF page-21 == folio 20, page-23 == folio 22). Home-world folio OCR was garbled ('99'/'1') so folios are derived from the anchor, not read off these pages -- spot-check the page images if in doubt.",
      "Frontier World (folio 9): +5 S, -5 Int; Survival+Wrangling trained; +1 wound already folded into Starting Wounds 1d5+2; traits Leery of Outsiders / Tenacious Survivalist / Xenos Interaction.",
      "Footfallen (folio 10): -5 BS, -5 T, +5 Ag, +5 Fel; Common Lore (Koronus Expanse) trained; Peer choice (Astropaths/the Insane/Underworld/Void Born/Workers); Polyglot; Psyniscience trained (NOT a psyker); Rival (Inquisition); Street Knowledge trait.",
      "Fortress World (folio 11): +5 BS, +5 WP, -5 Int, -5 Fel; Secret Tongue (Military)+Common Lore (War) trained; Hatred (chosen enemy); Basic Weapon Training (Las or SP); Nerves of Steel; Constant Combat Training trait (-5 non-combat social).",
      "Battlefleet (folio 12): +5 WP, +3 Fel, -5 Per; Common Lore (Imperial Navy)+Speak Language (Battlefleet War Cant) trained; Navigation (Stellar) OR Pilot (Spacecraft) trained; Void Accustomed trait; Officer on Deck + Ship-Bound Fighter traits.",
      "Penal World (folio 13): -5 WP, +5 Per, +5 T, -5 Fel; Security as untrained basic; Deceive OR Intimidate trained; Peer (Underworld); 1d5 Insanity + Light Sleeper (Nightmares); Criminal + Underground Resources traits.",
      "Child of Dynasty (folio 14): -3 T, +3 Int, -5 WP, +5 Fel; Literacy+Speak Language (High Gothic) trained; Enemy (unseen) talent; Dynastic Warrant (+3 Ship Points -- Stage 5, recorded as trait pending ship-point modelling); Honour Amongst One's Peers trait."
    ],
